WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
You care so much about winning or losing

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,160
Not as good as our rock-paper-scissors

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,080
How about playing until you win as much as you can

4
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,600
Other veteran players have told me

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,880
Only non-gamers can't hear things about games

6
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,840
I know you can hear me

7
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,280
We are the same kind of people now

8
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:12,840
Stop making trouble

9
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:13,920
Let's have a good chat

10
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,760
I was wrong to Lao and Nibi in the past

11
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,080
You are angry and want to take revenge on me. Let's find another way.

12
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,160
Can I give you money?

13
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,520
Why do you have to raise your fist when you give me money?

14
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,720
Do you dare to say that you can't see this skeleton and that one?

15
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,440
Don’t you want to introduce me to a job?

16
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,520
In other words, there is no such job as you mentioned.

17
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,520
you don't want to lose face

18
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,680
That’s why I did this

19
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,280
Let's just say where is the skeleton on your hand?

20
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,200
Haven't you had enough? You have too

21
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,640
Can you please stop making trouble?

22
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:39,310
There's no covering up like liquid foundation

23
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:42,540
Nothing hurts up there

24
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:45,260
Is the Rou family in the copy a fake?

25
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,580
Or is the one in front of me fake?

26
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:52,090
Did I blow my job again?

27
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:54,210
Although Qiu Xue's hard work was blown

28
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:55,330
But such an expensive meal

29
00:00:55,330 --> 00:00:58,130
I'd better eat ten of them until I'm in my stomach.

30
00:00:58,130 --> 00:01:01,300
I'll forgive him

31
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:03,300
Hello, who is me?

32
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:05,280
It’s better not to save my phone number

33
00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:07,620
I have a hard time forgetting

34
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:10,180
You are looking for me

35
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,380
I keep my word

36
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:13,740
The work I promised you has been arranged by someone else

37
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:15,020
They should be there by tonight

38
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:17,100
Call you to explain the details

39
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,620
Prepare your ID card and person

40
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:21,260
Clear out the three days of No. 8, No. 9 and No. 10.

41
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:23,980
When the time comes, I'll just go to the stadium and do the logistics.
